<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM load factor rises in March.</title>
<headline>KLM load factor rises in March.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional traffic and load factor figures from KLM Royal Dutch Airlines</p>
<p>(millions of tonne-kilometres unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>			  March 97  March 96 Apr-Mar96/97 Apr-Mar95/96</p>
<p>TOTAL TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic		    780.8     728.8	8,633.5	8,107.5</p>
<p>Capacity		   999.0     969.8     11,834.7     11,193.6</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	 78.2	75.1	   73.0	   72.4</p>
<p>PASSENGER TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Passenger kilometres 4,638.8   4,021.0     50,369.6     45,530.6</p>
<p>Seat kilometres	5,723.2   5,188.9     66,362.2     61,195.6</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	 81.1	77.5	   75.9	   74.4</p>
<p>FREIGHT TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic		    341.1     348.0	3,881.2	3,813.5</p>
<p>Capacity		   468.1     494.5	5,852.4	5,719.1</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	 72.9	70.4	   66.3	   66.7</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
